Echo command

Echo command is used to display message or the content on the terminal

Note: By using echo command we can redirect the content to a file

syntax: echo >message>

Above command will display the content on the terminal

....................................

echo <content> > <file-name>

ex: echo "good morning" > file1.txt

Above command will replace the content of file1.txt with good morning

.............................

echo <content> >> <file-name>

ex: echo "good morning" >> file1.txt

Above command will append the content to file1.txt 

